MeshCore One Android performance tooling (WP-504)

Application/tooling source remains covered by the repository's GPL-3.0 license.
The immutable MeshCore protocol specification retains its MIT notice.

AndroidX Benchmark Macro/JUnit4 1.5.0 is published by the Android Open Source
Project under Apache-2.0:
https://dl.google.com/dl/android/maven2/androidx/benchmark/benchmark-macro-junit4/1.5.0/benchmark-macro-junit4-1.5.0.pom
Source: https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/support/

The producer is development-only and is not linked into the shipping app.
Its complete resolved dependency versions/checksums are Gradle-generated in
android/gradle/dependency-locks/benchmark.lockfile and verification-metadata.xml.
benchmarkDependencyInventory records every actually resolved instrumentation
component's declared or inherited license, exact POM coordinate and POM hash.
Those inputs are not a legal compatibility approval or a release SBOM.

The target reuses the app's existing GPL/MIT/Apache/MapLibre notices verbatim.
No tile, glyph, sprite, third-party dataset or provider asset is bundled by
the self-authored local map workload. All workload text and coordinates are
synthetic WP-504 inputs, not captured messages, device identities or measurements.
